Package: orbivisor-restore-image
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Orbivisor developers <gaiger777@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: orbivisor (= @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gaiger777/opLite
Description: Orbivisor file restore helper VM image
 The kernel and initramfs of the disposable helper VM that Orbivisor starts
 to browse VM backups and download single files from them (file-level
 restore). The guest kernel, not the host, reads the filesystems in the
 backup. The image is built from the Debian 13 packages pinned in
 /usr/share/doc/orbivisor-restore-image/debian.lock and the Orbivisor
 restore agent.
